+        "an ordinary DegradedModeOverride able to unlock IRRECOVERABLE", "H9", [
+    (_P30,
+     "**A `DegradedModeOverride` can never unlock row 1**, in any state. Item 5's "
+     "*\"never rows 1 or 2\"* is unchanged, `51 §3.6`'s structural "
