+# 36 — Architecture Validation Plan
+
+**ACOS Operating Spine v1.3. Version 1.3. Issued 2026-09-03.**
+
+## v1.3.3 change record
+
+`VC-A6`'s fixture is re-based on `51 §3.7`'s declared `$20.00` floor and the `$20.01 … $25.00` band, because the previous `$30`/`$25` fixture is inadmissible under `per_action_max`. `VC-A2e` gains the FULL-HALT composition leg. **New `VC-A2g`** (the two timing thresholds, their exact inclusive boundaries, the timer's start/reset semantics and the prolonged-unreachability vulnerable control) and **new `VC-A2h`** (`STORE_WRITE_REJECTED`'s ten-condition derivation, its exclusions and its mandatory positive control). No existing case was weakened. Full disposition in `phase2-v1.3.3-errata.md`.
+
+## v1.3 change record
+
+§6's mirror row and §14's chaos row corrected to the state-qualified behaviour (TA-07); §12's `I7` oracle figures corrected to the v1.2/v1.3 fixture (TB-09); VC-A1d, VC-A2c–A2f and VC-S5–S8 added. Full disposition in `phase2-v1.3-remediation-ledger.md`.
+
