+    EXECUTING --> ATTEMPT_UNRESOLVED: timeout / ambiguous
+    ATTEMPT_UNRESOLVED --> VERIFYING: reconciler resolved
+    ATTEMPT_UNRESOLVED --> INCIDENT: unresolved past SLA
