+Source: `redteam3/60-third-redteam-attack-register.md` §1, §3 and §6. `62 §12` item 2 authorises the eight remaining items to follow S1's start; **TB-09 and TOS-04 are not in this register** — they are applied now and recorded in `phase2-v1.3-remediation-ledger.md §5`.
