+|---|---|---|
+| 1 Jan, `campaign.budget.set` $6.00/day | `LIVE`; `standing_window_exposure(s1, W_MONTH_ADSPEND, 2026-01)` created, `standing_cap = $186.00` | Permits (V6) |
