+**MATERIAL** · Mechanism B · `51 §2` `W_MONTH_ADSPEND`, `51 §3.2`, `26 §10.1`, `24 §3` K5, registry `I3`, `I18d` · **S1 blocking: yes (schema)** · in scope via B8
